6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DqlPeQ7CWuEQ7kNvwHw8nym&_nc_oc=Adnj-qNoFEUaRJQXyW-R8_notb6LaokIiKR1tUvoJHMCXxFD0NTKVEVPxBUWIXIB1Rk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxxxATpsElr62iZmSY-eeKoybiRL4qtQ6nz93K7_vul6A&oe=69B2A60C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer_cover.png", "id": "853816492160058", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003248_853816495493391_1038613569093630295_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SSTF4FThfrIQ7kNvwFFqG2Q&_nc_oc=AdmDbJyouKDuFIFhtFDa0-oM3SrwP5lDFED4zj-yCQLAXrd_eYzadKH6lYv1G9ksMLI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxy2M46CuAwgacMCtkz29UjGS2cEs6xjQnYmtl4KszQKg&oe=69B2C68E"}, "display_name": "VR Pigeons", "keywords": [], "long_description": "All the world\u2019s a rooftop, and all the men and women merely pigeons. \n\nUse the power of VR and absolutely unique movement controls to slip into your pigeon-self!\nGo out into the world and find a rooftop. Wait for the granny to throw some bread. Eat as much bread as possible! BREAD IS LIFE!\n\n\nHow to become the ultimate VR Pigeon:\n\n\u2022 Channel to your inner Pigeon. Bob your head like a pigeon in order to move around and interact with your world\n\u2022 Unlock and discover four different levels\n\u2022 Protect your bread from other pigeons\n\u2022 Use power-ups and map shortcuts to be faster than other pigeons\n\u2022 Your pigeon enemies come in different shapes, avoid unnecessary conflicts!", "short_description": "All the world\u2019s a rooftop, and all the men and women merely pigeons. \n\nUse the power of VR and absolutely unique movement controls to slip into your pigeon-self!\nGo out into the world and find a rooftop. Wait for the granny to throw some bread. Eat as much bread as possible! BREAD IS LIFE!"}]}, "developer_name": "Maestro Pivetta", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vrkiwi.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/VR-Pigeons-EULA.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_u